WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:30.447 --> 00:00:31.239
Major!

00:00:49.507 --> 00:00:50.341
Here they come.

00:00:58.099 --> 00:00:59.100
Damn it!

00:01:38.306 --> 00:01:39.682
Stop right there!

00:01:44.395 --> 00:01:46.523
What is he, some kind of freak?

00:01:50.693 --> 00:01:52.195
Get this cyberlock off me!

00:02:03.039 --> 00:02:04.207
A clothes closet?

00:02:04.874 --> 00:02:06.459
Is he done free-balling it?

00:02:07.877 --> 00:02:09.087
Use a tear gas round.

00:02:11.548 --> 00:02:13.091
Batou, away from the door!

00:02:25.436 --> 00:02:28.273
He had an armored suit in there?

00:02:28.565 --> 00:02:30.775
Must be nice to be that rich.

00:02:30.900 --> 00:02:34.487
Damn that Smith.
Bet he knew we'd have to deal with this.

